        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: A. J. Preller, Matt Kemp, Justin Upton, Wil Myers, Craig Kimbrel\n- Organizations: San Diego Padres, Texas Rangers\n- Roles: General manager, assistant GM, All-Star closer\n- Events: 2014 hiring, 2015 offseason acquisitions\n\nFacts:\n- A. J. Preller was hired by the San Diego Padres on August 5, 2014 while serving as the assistant GM for the Texas Rangers.\n- A. J. Preller is the general manager of the San Diego Padres Major League Baseball club.\n- During the 2015 offseason, San Diego Padres general manager A. J. Preller acquired Matt Kemp, Justin Upton, and Wil Myers to form a new starting outfield.\n- During the 2015 offseason, A. J. Preller also added All-Star closer Craig Kimbrel to the San Diego Padres bullpen.",
